From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: matthane <matthan.evans@icloud.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 13:28:03 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] VideoPlayer: add an action to go to the top menu of a disc

ShowVideoMenu opens the popup menu of a Blu-ray and falls back to the
top menu only when the disc rejects the popup key. A BD-J program can
take the key and ignore it, for example during an extra, and then
nothing leads back to the menu but stop. Players have a separate top
menu key for this.
